3a:["$","$L37","burgundy-kani-weave-pashmina-shawl",{"product":{"id":"burgundy-kani-weave-pashmina-shawl","slug":"burgundy-kani-weave-pashmina-shawl","name":"Burgundy Kani Weave Pashmina Shawl","tagline":"Woven thread by thread on wooden kanis.","description":"Kani weaving builds the pattern into the cloth itself, using dozens of small wooden bobbins instead of a shuttle. A single line of weft can take a full day.","story":["The kani technique survives in a handful of villages around Kanihama, outside Srinagar. Weavers work from a coded pattern called a talim, a script that has been passed down for generations and can only be read by those trained in it.","Deep burgundy is the traditional ground for bridal kani, offset here with an antique gold pallav at either end."],"gender":"women","categorySlug":"womens-shawls","collectionSlugs":["womens-shawls","womens-pashmina","pashmina","kashmiri-collection","wedding-collection","luxury-collection","heritage-collection"],"material":"Pure Pashmina","materialSlug":"pure-pashmina","pattern":"Kani Weave","patternSlug":"kani","craft":"Hand-woven kani technique from a talim pattern script","price":47999,"compareAtPrice":59999,"currency":"INR","images":[{"url":"/images/products/burgundy-kani-weave-pashmina-shawl-1.png","alt":"Pashmore women's burgundy kani weave pashmina shawl in burgundy, photographed flat to show the full drape","width":800,"height":1000,"isPrimary":true},{"url":"/images/products/burgundy-kani-weave-pashmina-shawl-2.png","alt":"Pashmore women's burgundy kani weave pashmina shawl in burgundy, detail view of the hand-finished border","width":800,"height":1000,"isPrimary":false},{"url":"/images/products/burgundy-kani-weave-pashmina-shawl-3.png","alt":"Pashmore women's burgundy kani weave pashmina shawl in burgundy, macro close-up of the woven texture","width":800,"height":1000,"isPrimary":false},{"url":"/images/products/burgundy-kani-weave-pashmina-shawl-4.png","alt":"Pashmore women's burgundy kani weave pashmina sh